{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12204150","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204150","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1220415001:0":{"text":"あの、すみません！「鉄の拳」スタントンさんの居場所を知りませんか？","source_cn":"这位先生，你好！请问你知道“铁拳”斯坦顿住在哪里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x072E36A5397991CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220415002:0":{"text":"「鉄の拳」か、今日の試合はイマイチだったな……そうだ、質問はなんだっけ？","source_cn":"“铁拳”啊，今天的表现很不尽人意……对了，你刚问什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F300B2BAADAD0FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220415003:0":{"text":"……「鉄の拳」の居場所ですよ。","source_cn":"……“铁拳”的住址。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCEFE7DD0FB7A0B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220415004:0":{"text":"あぁ、あいつならホワイトシャークに住んでるよ。橋を渡った向こうのところさ。","source_cn":"哦，他住在白鲨鱼街，桥对面的那个区里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8B18490DD194D44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220415005:0":{"text":"ありがとうございます！彼とは仲がいいんですか？","source_cn":"非常感谢！你知道他家，是跟他很熟悉吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF40183EA94E5183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220415006:0":{"text":"あいつに期待しない方がいいぞ。あの負けっぷりは見てられなかったよ。","source_cn":"照我看，最好别对他有什么期望，他这场输得太难看了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A7E5DC596520A50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220415007:0":{"text":"もしかして、スタントンさんに賭けたんですか……？","source_cn":"咦，难道你下注斯坦顿赢，结果事与愿违？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x792A35EAC058D9B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220415008:0":{"text":"あいつはたぶん……はぁ、まぁいいボクサーはあいつだけじゃないからな……","source_cn":"他应该是……唉，就这样吧，好拳手不止他一个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDCCF336C5270F1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220415009:0":{"text":"元々気に入ってた選手だから残念だよ。","source_cn":"可惜了，我本来很看好他的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x590ACB770F98C65D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220415010:0":{"text":"スタントンさんの居場所が分かりましたし、会いに行きましょう！","source_cn":"既然知道了斯坦顿的住址，咱们快去找他吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE355FAE6042B2C44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:自言自语的人":{"text":"独り言をつぶやく人","source":"自言自语的人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":3}}